THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This repository bundles third-party HDL, each retaining its own copyright and
licence notice in its source file headers. Those notices must be preserved.

  T80/                      Z80 CPU core. BSD-style licence (see file headers).
                            Copyright (c) 2001-2002 Daniel Wallner
                            Copyright (c) 2018 Sorgelig (Alexey Melnikov)
                            With work by Mike Johnson / MikeJ (FPGAArcade),
                            Sean Riddle and TobiFlex.

  src/fpga/core/            SDRAM controller, ROM data loader, I2S audio and
                            sync FIFO. MIT licence (see file headers).
                            Copyright (c) 2022-2023 Adam Gastineau (agg23)

  src/fpga/apf/,            Analogue Pocket openFPGA framework (APF), the
  core_bridge_cmd.v,        bridge command handler, and the reference core_top
  core_top.v                this core's shell is adapted from.
                            Copyright (c) Analogue Enterprises Limited.
                            Used under the Analogue Pocket EULA:
                            https://www.analogue.link/pocket-eula

  mf_*.v, pll*.v            Intel/Altera megafunction output generated by
                            Quartus Prime. Subject to the Intel FPGA software
                            licence terms.
